      "writtenOn": "2022-10-17T14:07:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm. NDK has no need for \"functions that must be implemented by the client\", I think, and so no convention for them? It\u0027s part of the same API, even if it\u0027s implemented by a different party.\n\nBut TBH I\u0027m assuming the naming and much else will change when we start talking to NDK API council.",
